src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.webm?t=1768434157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILDLIFE &amp; ECOSYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predators stalk, prey flees, and the world breathes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of species coexist within this ecosystem. Some hunt you, others run from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mammoths migrate, crocodiles guard rivers, birds take flight, and rodents scatter in panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature behaves differently; in this world, life and death constantly shift places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.poster.avif?t=1768434157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.webm?t=1768434157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIBES AND EARLY SOCIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own tribe or encounter others. Trade, fight, or unite to survive against the harshness of nature. Primitive communication and early belief systems form the foundation of human culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.poster.avif?t=1768434157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it